# NV-02 — To chuc va don vi

UC: 9-17  
Actors: system administrator, coordinator  
Status: specified; implementation pending.

## Scope

Create/edit/view/deactivate/delete units, organization tree, reception endpoints, topic-to-unit routing, Excel import/export and advanced search.

## Acceptance criteria

- A unit cannot be deleted while referenced by users, roles, dossiers or routing rules.
- Tree changes preserve parent/child scope and create an audit event.
- Routing lookup returns one responsible endpoint plus fallback coordinator.
- Imports validate duplicate code, parent, active state and rollback on error.

## Test mapping

`organization.repository.spec.ts`, `organization-routing.service.spec.ts` (planned).

